# The machine. A listening machine runs a script sent with -loc, the stdio door runs session commands, --listen stop ends it.
** spec: library/machine.md
** The runner starts `eve --listen` here; check/client.py talks to it and to `eve --stdio`, then stops it.
primary aspect s21_machine is
  process main is
    new n := 0;
    for k in (1..10) do
      let n += k;
    done;
    print "sum {n}";
  return;
end s21_machine;
